    <statement><p>If <m>f(x)=x^{2} +7</m>, find and simplify the following:</p>
<p><alert>(a)</alert> <m>f(t+2) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert>(b)</alert> <m>f(t^5+2) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><alert>(c)</alert> <m>f(5) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p><alert>(d)</alert> <m>5 f(t) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
<p><alert>(e)</alert> <m>(f(t))^2+2 =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0005"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>t^{2}+4t+11</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>t^{10}+4t^{5}+11</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>32</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>5t^{2}+35</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>t^{4}+14t^{2}+51</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert>(a)</alert>
<m>f(t+2) = (t+2)^2+7 = t^2+2 (2 t)+2^2+7 = t^2+4 t+11</m>



<alert>(b)</alert> 
<m>f(t^5+2) = (t^5+2)^2+7 = t^{2 (5)}+2 (2 t^{5})+2^2+7 =
    t^{10}+4 t^{5}+11</m>



<alert>(c)</alert> <m>f(5) = (5)^2+7 = 25+7 = 32</m>



<alert>(d)</alert> <m>5 f(t) = 5 (t^2+7)  = 5 t^2+35</m>



<alert>(e)</alert> 
<m>f(t)^{2}+2 = (t^2+7)^2+2 = t^4+2 (7 t^2) + 7^2+2 =
    t^4+14 t^2+51</m>.



</solution>
